<PageTitle>About The Singularity Workshop</PageTitle>

<h1>About The Singularity Workshop</h1>

<p>
    The Singularity Workshop is dedicated to building the foundational tools for the next generation
    of digital experiences. Our vision is to provide developers with simple, powerful, and reusable
    building blocks, starting with the **FSM_API**, to manage complexity and accelerate the creation
    of sophisticated virtual worlds.
</p>

<p>
    We believe that explicit state management is key to reliable, maintainable, and scalable
    application logic, whether in game development, business process automation, or digital simulation.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>
    To empower developers by providing the highest quality, engine-agnostic core logic framework
    and a massive library of modular, state-driven behaviors.
</p>